    },
    {
      "displayText": "Viscooo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006900730063006F006F006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Einen Moment, <U+0010><U+0004>ᄀÿ਋<U+0000>junger Mannjunge Frau!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450069006E0065006E0020004D006F006D0065006E0074002C002000100004110000FF0A0B0000006A0075006E0067006500720020004D0061006E006E006A0075006E0067006500200046007200610075002100100002011400040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hast du kurz Zeit für ein paar Fragen?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061007300740020006400750020006B00750072007A0020005A0065006900740020006600FC0072002000650069006E00200070006100610072002000460072006100670065006E003F00100002011400040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ist das dein Pokémon?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490073007400200064006100730020006400650069006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E003F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nein.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00650069006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hab es noch nie zuvor gesehen...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006100620020006500730020006E006F006300680020006E006900650020007A00750076006F00720020006700650073006500680065006E002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nVor mir sind eine Bank voller Schleim, ein Viscora,\ndas darauf sitzt, und du, <U+0010><U+0004>ᄀÿ̃<U+0000>derdie direkt danebensteht.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ich muss herausfinden, was hier los ist, damit\nich verhindern kann, dass so was wieder passiert.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nUnd du bist hier gerade <U+0010><U+0004>ᄀÿတ<U+0000>der Einzige, dendie Einzige, die ich\nausfragen kann.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 187
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Also: Weißt du, wem dieses Viscora gehört?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C0073006F003A002000570065006900DF0074002000640075002C002000770065006D002000640069006500730065007300200056006900730063006F00720061002000670065006800F600720074003F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Keine Ahnung.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B00650069006E0065002000410068006E0075006E0067002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Einem anderen Trainer vielleicht?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450069006E0065006D00200061006E0064006500720065006E00200054007200610069006E006500720020007600690065006C006C00650069006300680074003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Kein Kommentar.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B00650069006E0020004B006F006D006D0065006E007400610072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Verstehe...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560065007200730074006500680065002E002E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D006D002E002E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Und was hat dich heute Abend zu dieser Bank\nverschlagen, wenn das nicht dein Viscora ist?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ich wollte es streicheln.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490063006800200077006F006C006C00740065002000650073002000730074007200650069006300680065006C006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ich wollte mich da hinsetzen.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490063006800200077006F006C006C007400650020006D006900630068002000640061002000680069006E007300650074007A0065006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Kein Kommentar.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B00650069006E0020004B006F006D006D0065006E007400610072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aha, okay...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100680061002C0020006F006B00610079002E002E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D006D002E002E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Kommst du hier aus der Gegend? Kennst du\nvielleicht jemanden, der mir mehr über dieses<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nViscora sagen könnte?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 116
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ich mache hier nur Urlaub.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006300680020006D0061006300680065002000680069006500720020006E00750072002000550072006C006100750062002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Kein Kommentar.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B00650069006E0020004B006F006D006D0065006E007400610072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ach, wirklich?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100630068002C0020007700690072006B006C006900630068003F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D006D002E002E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Du bist dir also wirklich ganz sicher, dass dieses\nViscora nicht zu dir gehört?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hundertprozentig sicher.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480075006E006400650072007400700072006F007A0065006E0074006900670020007300690063006800650072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ich kenne es wirklich nicht.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006300680020006B0065006E006E00650020006500730020007700690072006B006C0069006300680020006E0069006300680074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Du weißt schon, dass es nicht schlimm wäre,\nwenn das Viscora zu dir gehören würde?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIch will einfach nur herausfinden, was hier vor\nsich geht.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 149
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Viscooo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006900730063006F006F006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dafür, dass es nicht dein Pokémon ist, scheint es\ndich aber ziemlich gernzuhaben...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wenn das nicht dein Viscora ist, dann zeig mir\ndoch mal, welche Pokémon du wirklich im<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nTeam hast.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Du verstehst, was ich meine, oder? Ich will sie\nmir in einem Pokémon-Kampf ansehen!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Du hast definitiv ordentlich gekämpft. Das muss\nich dir lassen.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400750020006800610073007400200064006500660069006E00690074006900760020006F007200640065006E0074006C006900630068002000670065006B00E4006D007000660074002E00200044006100730020006D007500730073000A00690063006800200064006900720020006C0061007300730065006E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gibst du JETZT zu, dass das dein Viscora ist?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 3724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700690062007300740020006400750020004A00450054005A00540020007A0075002C0020006400610073007300200064006100730020006400650069006E00200056006900730063006F007200610020006900730074003F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Viscora! Du kannst doch nicht einfach abhauen!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 3824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006900730063006F0072006100210020004400750020006B0061006E006E0073007400200064006F006300680020006E0069006300680074002000650069006E00660061006300680020006100620068006100750065006E002100100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Viscooora...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 3928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006900730063006F006F006F00720061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Und du hast die Bank vollgeschleimt...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 3956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0064002000640075002000680061007300740020006400690065002000420061006E006B00200076006F006C006C00670065007300630068006C00650069006D0074002E002E002E00100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So, jetzt ist die Bank wieder picobello sauber.\nLass uns heimgehen, Viscora!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, ähm... Es war wirklich nicht dein Viscora.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 4208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C002000E40068006D002E002E002E00200045007300200077006100720020007700690072006B006C0069006300680020006E00690063006800740020006400650069006E00200056006900730063006F00720061002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Das mit dem Missverständnis tut mir leid.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIn Illumina tauchen immer mehr wilde Pokémon\nauf, weißt du.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIn letzter Zeit bin ich bei jedem Anzeichen von\nÄrger sofort auf der Hut.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 4312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 186
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Als Entschuldigung verrate ich dir etwas.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDamit Viscora seine letzte Entwicklungsstufe\nerreicht, benötigst du Regen.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 4684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Und damit verabschiede ich mich. Bis dann!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 4932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0064002000640061006D00690074002000760065007200610062007300630068006900650064006500200069006300680020006D006900630068002E0020004200690073002000640061006E006E0021001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    }
